---
---

<div class="px-4" id="testimonial">
  <div class="mb-10">
    <figure class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
    <svg
      aria-hidden="true"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      fill="currentColor"
      class="mx-auto size-8 text-primary"
    >
      <path
        d="M7.17 6.17A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 3 11.5V18a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h6.5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-6a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H6.06a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 2.35-2.79 1 1 0 1 0-.62-1.9Zm10 0A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 13 11.5V18a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h6.5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-6a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4.44a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 2.35-2.79 1 1 0 1 0-.62-1.9Z"
      />
    </svg>
  
    <blockquote class="mt-4">
      <p class="text-xl font-medium text-pretty text-secondary sm:text-2xl">
        Prediksi tagihannya membantu banget buat ngatur anggaran bulanan. Nggak ada lagi cerita kaget pas token listrik bunyi.
      </p>
    </blockquote>
  
    <figcaption class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <img
        alt=""
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573497019940-1c28c88b4f3e?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=200"
        class="size-10 rounded-full object-cover"
      />
  
      <div class="text-left ltr:text-left rtl:text-right">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-secondary">Rina Lestari</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-secondary/60">Ibu Rumah Tangga</p>
      </div>
    </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
  <ul class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <li class="flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-accent/30 bg-theme-white p-6">
      <blockquote class="flex-1 text-sm text-secondary/70">
        Tampilan webnya bersih dan gampang dipakai. Masukin data 5 bulan terakhir langsung keluar hasil estimasinya tanpa ribet.
      </blockquote>
  
      <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <img
          alt=""
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633332755192-727a05c4013d?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=200"
          class="size-9 rounded-full object-cover"
        />
  
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-secondary">Dimas Pratama</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-secondary/60">Pemilik Kos</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </li>
  
    <li class="flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-accent/30 bg-theme-white p-6">
      <blockquote class="flex-1 text-sm text-secondary/70">
        Sangat membantu untuk memantau tren pemakaian listrik tempat usaha saya agar tetap efisien setiap bulannya.”
      </blockquote>
  
      <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <img
          alt=""
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601412436009-d964bd02edbc?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=200"
          class="size-9 rounded-full object-cover"
        />
  
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-secondary">Siska Amelia</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-secondary/60">Pegiat UMKM</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </li>
  
    <li class="flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-accent/30 bg-theme-white p-6">
      <blockquote class="flex-1 text-sm text-secondary/70">
        Simpel, cepat, dan akurasinya ngebantu banget buat bikin estimasi pengeluaran listrik kedepan.
      </blockquote>
  
      <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <img
          alt=""
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580489944761-15a19d654956?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=200"
          class="size-9 rounded-full object-cover"
        />
  
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-secondary">Fajar Nugroho</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-secondary/60">Mahasiswa</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>